Purpose:
Remove unwanted front micro-labels and flat printed control text. Preserve
the whole handheld, website logo, accessible controls and genuine power/input.

Tasks:
- [x] Remove front POWER/BBA-001 decals; retain the physical LED.
- [x] Replace button/arrow and START/SELECT printing with same-material 3D lettering.
