Acceptance criteria:
- No front POWER or BBA-001 printed planes remain.
- Control lettering has real beveled depth, normals and shadows, not a colored
  texture. A/B/shoulder/D-pad markings move with their physical caps;
  START/SELECT markings share the surrounding shell's plastic.
- Bezel retains the supplied logo's distinctive lettering, monochrome and
  star-free, without stretching or obscuring native game pixels.
- Normal play is closer at desktop/phone/landscape sizes, with the whole
  handheld and 44px power target clear of the header and dock.
- Original supplied PNG, aspect ratios, native core, controls, saves, startup,
  screen fullscreen and insertion/inspection behavior remain intact.

Completion evidence:
- Syntax/build/11units pass; six focused Edge cases pass1.2m, final five-size
